    {# ── Research mega-menu ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
       The flat 23-item Research list was reorganised into a grouped, multi-column
       frosted-glass mega panel: two flagship desks featured up top, then four
       intent-based columns (Forward Edge · Smart Money & Catalysts · Cycles &
       Cross-Asset · Policy & Quant Lab). Layout CSS is the <style> below — it
       lives in this shared partial so it reaches EVERY page (both the theme.css
       family and the self-contained vector family); the glass surface itself is
       inherited from the base .nav-dd-menu rule (frosted in theme.css and
       _vector_polish). Container overrides are scoped >700px so the mobile
       hamburger accordion (theme.js) keeps its stacked layout. #}
    <style>
    /* The Research trigger sits mid-row, so a trigger-anchored wide panel would
       clip off the left edge. Instead anchor the mega to the full-width .nav-links
       row (its right edge = the nav rail right): make .nav-links the positioning
       context and the Research .nav-dd static >700px, so right:0 right-aligns the
       panel to the rail and it stays fully on-screen. The ::before bridges the
       hover gap (the panel is a child of .nav-dd, so hovering it keeps it open). */
    @media (min-width:701px){
      /* nav-links is the positioning context for the rail-anchored mega; desktop
         only, so it never overrides theme.js's position:absolute hamburger flyout
         (≤700px), which shares this specificity. */
      .site-nav .nav-links,.topbar .nav-links{position:relative}
      .site-nav .nav-mega-dd,.topbar .nav-mega-dd{position:static}
      /* the base .nav-dd::after bridge would become a full-width strip once the
         trigger is static — disable it; the mega's own ::before bridges the gap. */
      .site-nav .nav-mega-dd::after,.topbar .nav-mega-dd::after{content:none}
      .site-nav .nav-dd-menu.nav-mega,.topbar .nav-dd-menu.nav-mega{
        left:auto;right:0;min-width:0;width:min(1060px,calc(100vw - 40px));padding:16px}
      .nav-dd-menu.nav-mega::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-11px;height:13px}
    }
    .nav-mega-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;
      padding-bottom:13px;margin-bottom:13px;
      border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--text,#cbd5e1) 11%,transparent)}
    .nav-mega.nav-mega .nm-feat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;
      white-space:normal;text-decoration:none;
      background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--link,var(--blue,#5b9dff)) 10%,transparent);
